WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.268
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.770
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.271
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.440
Well, it's 2024,

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.542
and you know what happens
later this year.

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:10.610
Oh, damn it!

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.079
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:14.747
I was going to say the Olympics.

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:16.949
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:18.718
At a campaign rally
in Iowa last week,

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.886
former President Trump said
that President Biden

00:00:20.886 --> 00:00:23.790
"can't put two sentences
together."

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:28.361
Um, have you heard him talk?
He can put, like, 100 together.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.263
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:31.864
The same rally
in Iowa last week,

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:34.267
former President Trump
said that the Civil War

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.534
"could have been negotiated."

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:36.702
That was crazy enough,

00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:38.504
but then he said
the Gettysburg Address

00:00:38.504 --> 00:00:39.839
could have been an e-mail.

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:42.375
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:44.444
Same rally, Trump also called
on President Biden

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:46.378
to release Capitol rioters
from prison.

00:00:46.378 --> 00:00:48.214
And I guess it was
only a matter of time

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:51.851
before he settled on the same
campaign platform as the Joker.

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:54.153
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:56.655
Former UN ambassador Nikki Haley
is facing criticism

00:00:56.655 --> 00:00:58.958
after she recently
failed to cite slavery

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:00.493
as the leading cause
of the Civil War.

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:03.963
And not only that, she's facing
a D in social studies.

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:06.632
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:08.067
According to a new report,

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:10.202
when the violence began to
escalate in the Capitol attack,

00:01:10.202 --> 00:01:12.471
then President Trump was
"just not interested

00:01:12.471 --> 00:01:13.973
in doing more to stop it."

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.308
Either that,
or he was exhausted

00:01:16.308 --> 00:01:18.177
from everything he had to do
to start it.

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:20.379
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.379 --> 00:01:22.482
When asked yesterday
about reports that she could be

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:24.884
former President Trump's
running mate in 2024,

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:27.086
Republican Congresswoman
Elise Stefanik

00:01:27.086 --> 00:01:30.223
said she would be "honored
to serve in any capacity

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:31.624
in a Trump administration."

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:34.827
Well, I'm pretty sure First Lady
is gonna be up for grabs.

00:01:34.827 --> 00:01:37.763
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.763 --> 00:01:40.266
Apple announced today
that its Vision Pro headset

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.368
will launch next month --
this news first reported

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:43.937
on your hand,
your wrist, your lap,

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.538
and, pretty soon, your face.

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:47.473
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:51.711
After their dog recently ate
an envelope filled with $4,000,

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:53.113
a couple in Pennsylvania

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:56.582
was able to recover
$3,500 in cash.

00:01:56.582 --> 00:01:59.619
Said their friends,
"You can just Venmo me."

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:02.888
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.888 --> 00:02:05.725
Taco Bell has begun offering
Crunchwrap Supreme

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:07.927
meal kits at Walmart,
which include tortillas,

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:10.095
crunchy tostada shells,
taco seasoning,

00:02:10.095 --> 00:02:11.297
and Velveeta cheese sauce.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:12.565
You can cook it at home,

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:14.534
then take it right out
to your car to eat it.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:17.704
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:19.572
The largest radio company
in the country

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:22.074
announced over the weekend that
it has filed for bankruptcy.

00:02:22.074 --> 00:02:23.276
If you haven't heard about it,

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:25.078
it's because they announced it
on the radio.

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:26.879
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:29.215
A man in Alabama
was arrested recently

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.084
after he allegedly
crashed his car

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:32.552
outside of a Bass Pro Shop,

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:35.388
took off his clothes, and jumped
into the store's aquarium.

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:37.056
But I'm not going to make
a joke about that

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:38.491
because it's low-hanging fruit.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:41.460
Actually...
after he jumped in the water,

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.029
it became high-hanging fruit.

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:44.931
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.770
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.438
Anybody who doesn't get it,
stay after

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:53.706
and we'll, like, do a...

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:56.075
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:58.878
Baze, I think, told me
he drew a diagram.

00:03:00.179 --> 00:03:01.714
[ Laughs ]

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:03.983
We should offer more,
like, stay after

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:05.118
if you didn't get
any of the jokes.

00:03:05.118 --> 00:03:08.487
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.487 --> 00:03:10.456
Someone over there has got
a very stern face.

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:11.457
Keep them after.

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:13.526
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:15.795
[ Chuckles ]

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:17.964
We'll be the only talk show
with detention.

00:03:17.964 --> 00:03:21.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.836
And finally, the CDC has issued
a recall

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:26.905
for more than 11,000 pounds
of ready-to-eat meat products.

00:03:26.905 --> 00:03:28.841
11,000 pounds of meat,

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:31.176
or, as it's also known,
in Arby's kid meal.

00:03:31.176 --> 00:03:33.079
Well, there we go.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:34.614
Now you know it's a new year.

00:03:34.614 --> 00:03:36.782
We've turned over
a new leaf on Arby's.

00:03:36.782 --> 00:03:38.084
That was a monologue,
everybody!

